el\">CURRENT</span><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-154,dashboards-944\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Tech Directory&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>34 - Technology Dashboard Directory</p></div></div></div>\n\t<div class=\"sa-nav-footer\">\n\t\t<div class=\"sa-nav-panel\">\n\n\t\t\t<h3>How to Use This Section</h3>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Start in Home for orientation, then open the Command Center for your role.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Use Executive for value and risk summaries.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Use Operational for alerts, health, and day-to-day triage.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Use Technical for investigation, collectors, modules, and adoption.</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"sa-nav-panel\">\n\n\t\t\t<h3>Current Dashboard</h3>\n\n\t\t\t<p class=\"sa-nav-note\">You are viewing <b>34 - Technology Dashboard Directory</b> in the <b>Technical</b> group. The highlighted CURRENT item marks this dashboard in the navigation menu.</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"sa-nav-pill-row\"><span class=\"sa-nav-pill\">Technical</span> <span class=\"sa-nav-pill\">Tech Directory</span></div></div></div></div>"
